Package: sassyRS
Title: 'extendr' Bindings to the 'sassy' Approximate String Matcher
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sounkou Mahamane", family = "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rick", "Beeloo", role = c("ctb", "cph")),
    person("Ragnar", "Groot Koerkamp", role = c("ctb", "cph"))
  )
Description: Provides prototype R bindings to the 'sassy' Rust crate using 'extendr'. It exposes a simple data-frame interface for approximate matching while the lower-level 'Rsassy' package can use R's native C API for explicit raw-vector and 'ALTREP' handling.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.91.0, xz
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    tinytest
